-- A dev subset of the teacher's banks of starci-lab/data at commit 231d8cc57-stem1: Fullstack banks 0 to 2 (the junior pool of Q-MI-1) and the behavioural banks 1 and 2,
-- exactly as `cli interview import --dir <data checkout> --ref 231d8cc57` stores them (the prompt is the question stem only: the hints the teacher wrote into it are left out; version 231d8cc57-stem1 supersedes the first dev seed), then published without the calibration pre-check (calibration.mode = dev-seed).
